	(text "The encoder connectors J8/J9 (field-wired) take their 3.3 V option from U18 (TPS70933, 30 V max,\nfrom RC_5V), not 3V3_CM4, so a miswired sensor supply cannot back-feed the CM4 or the GPS. U18 \nblocks reverse current, so it cannot reach RC_5V either. EN is left open (internal pull-up; \nnever tie EN to IN).\nF3 (100 mA PTC) sits between J9 and D23 (SMBJ3V3); F3 limits a shorted cable or a miswire\nonto J8/J9 while D23 clamps U18 OUT (7 V abs max). C81 >= 1.5 uF effective."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.538 164.084 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1435ea78-55ce-42d6-ab14-d593e0a3135d")
	)
