		(uuid "4acb9ac8-790a-4006-9d5c-64fcc199e4d8")
	)
	(text "JP5 QUAD: A/B, 1k pull-ups to 5 V, 100R/10nF.  JP5 ABS: 0-2 V on A, scale set by JP6"
